                  "Woodworking as design and fabrication with species, grain, moisture, joinery, tools, finishing, safe operation, and object longevity.",
                  "dated workshop plans and objects, measured wood and condition data, maker records, controlled tests, manufacturer instructions, and OSHA woodworking guidance",
